      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DR. WARREN (1) was never in contention last time after settling off pace at Sale, but prior to that won by 1.5 lengths at Sale (24.61) beating Lakeview Sky in a Grade 5 on August 23. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts. Can make amends. STORM COMING (3) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Geraldton Crew (24.53) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to give a sight. Leading chance. FURIOUS FALCON (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (25.00) in a Grade 5 at Sale. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. DR. AXEL (8) placed last time and cannot be ignored.",
